11
01:10:53,333 --> 01:10:59,333
The film stars Russell Crowe and Ryan Gosling in the title roles, with Angourie Rice, Matt Bomer,
Margaret Qualley, Keith David, and Kim Basinger appearing in supporting roles.

12
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
Set in the 70s Los Angeles, the film focuses on private eye Holland March (Gosling) and tough enforcer for hire
Jackson Healy (Crowe) who team up to investigate the disappearance of a teenage girl (Qualley).

13
01:23:46,666 --> 01:23:52,666
The Nice Guys premiered on May 10, 2016, in Hollywood, screened on May 15 at
the 2016 Cannes Film Festival and was released by Warner Bros.

14
